{
    "title": "Merge Archers: Bow and Arrow",
    "description": "Are you ready to fight for your king? Notch your arrows and join the war of bow and arrow! Merge bowmasters and create the strongest stickman archery squad to defend the castle. Play one of the coolest arrow games, become the greatest stickman archer hero and win the bow and arrow war!\r\n\r\nIn this turn-based 3D archery game, your goal is to defeat the enemy army and capture their castle! Tap the screen to command your stickman archers to aim and shoot at the opponents! Use every turn wisely and try not to miss unless you want to lose this bow and arrow war.\r\n\r\nThere is a tower of archers at your disposal. Merge identical stickman archers together to upgrade them! The more advanced archer heroes you recruit, the faster you can defeat your enemies.\r\n \r\nLet the arrow fest begin! Use bows, cannons, and other weapons to win the archery battle. This is one of the best bow and arrow games, where your strategy skills can help you defeat enemy stickman archers, even if they outnumber your own squad! \r\n \r\n<b>Why you\u2019ll love this 3D archery game:</b>\r\n \r\n- Unique archery mechanics\r\n- Exciting merge gameplay\r\n- Challenging levels\r\n- Many bow masters to defeat \r\n- Beautiful 3D graphics\r\n \r\nWhat are you waiting for? Merge your archers, fight bow masters, and capture enemy castles! Become the top merge master and destroy archer armies at one dash. Play one of the best bow and arrow games for free!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you ready to fight for your king? Notch your arrows and join the war of bow and arrow! Merge bowmasters and create the strongest stickman archery squad to defend the castle. Play one of the coolest arrow games, become the greatest stickman archer hero and win the bow and arrow war!<br><br>In this turn-based 3D archery game, your goal is to defeat the enemy army and capture their castle! Tap the screen to command your stickman archers to aim and shoot at the opponents! Use every turn wisely and try not to miss unless you want to lose this bow and arrow war.<br><br>There is a tower of archers at your disposal. Merge identical stickman archers together to upgrade them! The more advanced archer heroes you recruit, the faster you can defeat your enemies.<br> <br>Let the arrow fest begin! Use bows, cannons, and other weapons to win the archery battle. This is one of the best bow and arrow games, where your strategy skills can help you defeat enemy stickman archers, even if they outnumber your own squad! <br> <br><b>Why you\u2019ll love this 3D archery game:</b><br> <br>- Unique archery mechanics<br>- Exciting merge gameplay<br>- Challenging levels<br>- Many bow masters to defeat <br>- Beautiful 3D graphics<br> <br>What are you waiting for? Merge your archers, fight bow masters, and capture enemy castles! Become the top merge master and destroy archer armies at one dash. Play one of the best bow and arrow games for free!",
